{"task_id": "Mbpp/57", "solution": "def find_Max_Num(digits: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the largest number that can be formed with the given list of digits.\n    Converts the digits to strings, sorts them in descending order, then joins and converts to an integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    sorted_digits = sorted(digits, reverse=True)\n    digit_strings = [str(d) for d in sorted_digits]\n    concatenated_string = \"\".join(digit_strings)\n\n    if not concatenated_string:\n        return 0\n\n    return int(concatenated_string)"}
