{"task_id": "Mbpp/63", "solution": "def max_difference(tuple_list: list[tuple[float | int, float | int]]) -> float | int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the maximum absolute difference between elements in each pair of a tuple list.\n    Returns the single largest absolute difference found.\n    \"\"\"\n    max_diff = float('-inf')\n    for val1, val2 in tuple_list:\n        current_diff = abs(val1 - val2)\n        if current_diff > max_diff:\n            max_diff = current_diff\n    return max_diff"}
