{"task_id": "Mbpp/77", "solution": "def is_Diff(input_number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Determines if an integer is divisible by 11 based on the alternating sum of its digits.\n    \"\"\"\n    num_str = str(abs(input_number))\n\n    sum_odd_places = 0\n    sum_even_places = 0\n\n    for i, digit_char in enumerate(reversed(num_str)):\n        digit = int(digit_char)\n        if (i + 1) % 2 != 0:  # Odd place (1st, 3rd, 5th, ... from right)\n            sum_odd_places += digit\n        else:  # Even place (2nd, 4th, 6th, ... from right)\n            sum_even_places += digit\n\n    difference = sum_odd_places - sum_even_places\n    return difference % 11 == 0"}
